"   (nvim/.config/nvim/lua/core/keybinds.lua:6).
" - gcc and visual gc toggle comments (mini.comment, lua/plugins/mini.lua:60-67).
" - :w saves the notebook; gd goes to definition; zz/zt/zb scroll.
" - Ctrl+Esc enters marimo command mode (j/k, dd, yy, p/P, o/O on cells).
